+### IMPORT-079 — Normalize applicant note labels
+- **Type:** conversion
+- **Trigger:** A paragraph, including one inside a table cell, starts with `Note` or `Please note` followed by a colon or dash, or starts with the abbreviation `N.B.`. Matching is case-insensitive and allows the label to span inline formatting runs. An ASCII hyphen is a delimiter only when followed by whitespace or the end of the text run.
+- **Action:** Replace the label with bold **Note:**. Preserve the following text and inline formatting, adding a space when the label directly touches following text. Ordinary sentences and mid-paragraph occurrences stay as supplied.
+- **Source:** `content_processing.py::normalize_applicant_note_labels`
+- **Status:** active
